type: dataset
title: "ABER and Oral History: Comparison Rubric"
abstract: "A preliminary rubric of 33 criteria in four categories (Elicit, Re-tell, Interpret, Retain) that consolidates the disciplinary practices of oral history in a form that facilitates comparison with Automated Biographical Elicitation and Re-tell (ABER) and its product, auto-autobiography, a life narrative grounded in the documented reminiscences of a human author but retold by AI without methodological transparency."
